WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.402
-Well, guys, I know it's been
hard to travel this summer.

00:00:03.402 --> 00:00:04.637
Vacations and trips to see
family and friends

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:05.905
have been delayed or canceled,

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:08.174
but I just heard of a company
that will take you

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.642
on a different kind of vacation.

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:11.577
Check this out.

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:13.279
-Thank you very much.

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:15.281
Hello, there. I'm Chet Bevins,

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:17.751
travel agent,
sound bath conductor,

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:20.086
and the inventor
of the in-app purchase.

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:23.223
Now, I've put my years of
experience in travel, tech,

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:26.259
and wellness together to offer
you a brand-new opportunity.

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:29.061
So many of us have had to cancel
summer plans,

00:00:29.061 --> 00:00:31.363
trips to see loved ones,
and vacations,

00:00:31.363 --> 00:00:32.999
but now I'm inviting all of you

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:35.802
to go on a vacation
in your mind.

00:00:35.802 --> 00:00:37.470
So pack your dream luggage,

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:40.439
leave instructions for the cat
sitter in your subconscious,

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:41.841
and come with me on one of

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:44.543 line:0%
my new Imagination Vacation
packages.

00:00:44.543 --> 00:00:48.748 line:0%
Hyper-realistic, and I'm talking
hyper-realistic vacations

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:51.785 line:0%
that you can take from the
comfort of your very own brain.

00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:55.454
Let's take a little peek at
our tropical getaway package.

00:00:55.454 --> 00:00:58.724
You arrive at your gorgeous
five-star hotel.

00:00:58.724 --> 00:01:01.327
You're greeted with
a cold local drink

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:03.796
as you take in
the gorgeous surroundings.

00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:05.097
The concierge welcomes you

00:01:05.097 --> 00:01:08.000
with a smile and a customary
regional greeting.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.437
And they take your card and your
credit card isn't going through.

00:01:11.437 --> 00:01:12.939
Do you have another one?

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:14.974
And you're like, "No, I thought
I pre-paid."

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:17.643
And she's like, "Well, I just
need one for the incidentals."

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:19.745
And you're like, "Well, I don't
have another card."

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:21.380
And she's like,
"Okay, no problem.

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:23.616
There's an ATM at a gas station
30 miles from here.

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:26.185
It's accessible only by bus.

00:01:26.185 --> 00:01:29.889
The 'bus' only comes once a day,
but we never know when."

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:34.460
Totally vacation, totally
imagination, totally realistic.

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:36.028
As real as you can imagine it.

00:01:36.028 --> 00:01:37.363
And that's not all.

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:39.532
If tropical vacations
aren't your thing,

00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:42.135
check out our family
amusement park package.

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:45.738
The lot, the music,
the cotton candy, the rides.

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:47.507
There you are,
with your smiling family,

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:49.676
in line for the big kid
roller coaster

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:51.443
and getting close to
the end of your wait.

00:01:51.443 --> 00:01:54.547
You look down at your precious
children as their excitement --

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:56.816
and now they're punching
each other in the face.

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:58.784
Hey, this is what they wanted.

00:01:58.784 --> 00:02:00.286
"You wanted to go on this ride,

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:01.854
and now you're punching
each other?

00:02:01.854 --> 00:02:04.390
What do you want?"

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:07.293
Maybe taking to the slopes is
what your dreams are made of.

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:08.795
After a long day of skiing,

00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:10.830
it's time to dip your sore,
aching muscles

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.499
into the Olympic-sized
heated salt of --

00:02:13.499 --> 00:02:15.268
The pool's closed?

00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:17.069
For a dog wedding?

00:02:17.069 --> 00:02:18.771
What is that?

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:20.873
Just like in real life.

00:02:20.873 --> 00:02:23.442
Plus, we offer add-ons
to any existing package,

00:02:23.442 --> 00:02:26.979
including screaming kid
in first-class cabin,

00:02:26.979 --> 00:02:28.781
"took the wrong suitcase
at the airport

00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:31.717
and now you're wearing some
random guy's shorts all week,"

00:02:31.717 --> 00:02:35.354
traveler's tummy,
and our most popular add-on --

00:02:35.354 --> 00:02:39.091
fight with your spouse in Paris,
city of romance.

00:02:39.091 --> 00:02:42.461
Your partner looks at you,
disappointment in their eyes.

00:02:42.461 --> 00:02:45.197
"I thought you wanted to see
the Eiffel Tower," you say.

00:02:45.197 --> 00:02:48.367
"I didn't say I wanted
to walk there," they say.

00:02:48.367 --> 00:02:51.003
"I thought we were closer
than we were," you say.

00:02:51.003 --> 00:02:55.407
"Well, learn how to read a map.
You always do this," they say.

00:02:55.407 --> 00:02:59.312 line:0%
So sign up today for Chet
Bevins' Imagination Vacations.

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:01.647 line:0%
Your body's never gone on
a perfect vacation,

00:03:01.647 --> 00:03:04.750 line:0%
so why should your mind?

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.052 line:0%
Chet speaking.

